    "en": {
      "text": "Dealing damage with this weapon grants one stack of 'Fail-Deadly'. Maximum stacks are equal to this weapon's base magazine capacity. \n\nEach stack grants ? Range, ? Aim Assist, and +1 Base Magazine Capacity, up to 100% Capacity.\n\nThis increased Base Magazine Capacity will be considered the baseline for all other magazine-modifying traits, such as Overflow.\n\nAll stacks are removed upon scoring a weapon kill.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-21T18:23:16.104Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
